# `lo` and `hi`, declared without `%`, are registers, so %r2 packs the
# thread index and the store's lanes are a bound: only thread 0 runs it,
# where they were taken to be a whole warp or none, `warp: 4–5 sectors`.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/bare_registers.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // <= warp * × lane * | exec <= 64/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req <= 4 (ideal <= 4){{$}}
